---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import Glowcard from '~/components/glowcard.astro';

import '~/assets/styles/glow.css';
import '~/assets/styles/tailwind.css';

import lucienSvgUrl from '~/assets/lucien.svg?url';
---

<Layout>
  <section id="story" class="pt-10">
    <!-- 1 kaart -->
    <Glowcard>
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
        <!-- Intro buiten de kaart (kan ook in de kaart, maar dit leest lekker) -->
        <div class="mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-5xl font-extrabold mb-3">
            <span class="bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-mona bg-[length:200%_200%] animate-gradient-move">
              The Story
            </span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg font-medium opacity-90">
            Every great project starts with an idea. Here's the journey of The Mona.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-10">
          <!-- Block 1 -->
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Inspiration</h3>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed opacity-90">
              This project was born out of a love for creativity, technology, and the joy of bringing people together.
              The initial spark for The Mona came when we encountered “Odil de Krokodil,” a concept that quickly became
              a beloved part of our friend group. Inspired by the positive reception, we created our own version,
              “Lucien,” which was met with even more enthusiasm.
            </p>
            <img
              src={lucienSvgUrl}
              alt="Lucien"
              class="mt-6 w-full max-w-sm mx-auto opacity-95 drop-shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.15)]"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>

          <hr class="border-white/10" />

<!-- Block 2 -->
<div>
  <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Why “The Mona”?</h3>

  <p class="text-base leading-relaxed opacity-90 mb-4">
    When searching for a name, I wanted something that reflected a meaningful moment of renewal and inspiration in my life.
    The Mona represents a period where small moments regained their beauty and where the simple act of creating felt alive again.
    It marks a time when inspiration quietly returned, reminding me of the value of presence, curiosity, and feeling connected
    to what I was building.
  </p>

  <p class="text-base leading-relaxed opacity-90">
    This project captures the essence of that rediscovery — transforming a brief but impactful chapter into a creative
    expression of gratitude and forward momentum. While moments pass and paths change, what remains is the growth they spark.
    The Mona is a tribute to that process: holding onto what helped me move forward and turning it into something that can
    continue to inspire and create meaningful moments for others.
  </p>
</div>


          <hr class="border-white/10" />

          <!-- Block 3 -->
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">From idea to moments</h3>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed opacity-90">
              The Mona is built to be shared: simple, playful, and a little chaotic in the best way. A project that
              turns a small spark into something people can experience together — and hopefully laugh about later.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
              <a
                href="/demo"
                class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-mona-alt text-white hover:opacity-90 transition bg-[length:200%_200%] animate-gradient-move"
              >
                Try the demo
              </a>

              <a href="/#features" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-white/20 hover:bg-white/5 transition">
                See features
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Glowcard>
  </section>
</Layout>
